1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
Think about this: What should AI output
when an amount is missing?

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:05,840
Let’s work through it together.

3
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:11,840
I'm Doctor Gainz. Lesson 19: Use AI to
organize authorized

4
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:16,640
documents. Start an AI task with a
permitted purpose and the minimum

5
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:21,100
authorized material. For example: “Index
these fictional documents.

6
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:24,420
Extract the document date and stated
figure label.

7
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,520
Cite the page for each item.

8
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,040
Use unknown for missing information.

9
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:34,320
Do not infer an owner, contact
information, or legal entitlement.” This

10
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:37,880
turns a broad assistant into a constrained
administrative helper.

11
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:40,720
Review the output against the originals.

12
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:45,800
AI can confuse a bid with a balance, merge
two people, overlook a date

13
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:48,280
qualifier, or invent a missing field.

14
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:51,160
Keep an evidence column and a review
status.

15
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:54,780
Do not use a confidence score as a
replacement for a source.

16
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:59,440
Use private storage appropriate to the
client material rather than public

17
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:01,840
website assets or shared marketing files.

18
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:04,460
This free course teaches the workflow.

19
00:01:04,820 --> 00:01:09,660
It does not activate live agents, purchase
data, send messages, or verify a

20
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:14,240
case by itself. Money Masteries paid tools
and activated services have

21
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:16,060
separate access and usage terms.

22
00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:18,040
Pause and try this.

23
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:22,380
Run a document-index exercise using only
fictional material.

24
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:26,420
Correct at least one intentionally missing
or ambiguous field.

25
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:31,420
Quick knowledge check. What should AI
output when an amount is missing?

26
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:35,500
The answer: Unknown with the missing
source identified.

27
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:40,200
Missing financial information must remain
missing until a reliable source

28
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:44,280
supplies it. Keep the source, the date,
and the unknowns visible.

29
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:45,980
I'll see you in the next lesson.
